                            <text x="50%" y="50%" fill="#eceeef" dy=".3em">Dr. Xuyu Zhang</text>
                        </svg>
                        <div id="profile01" class="card-body">
                            <h6 class="about_title_weight">Dr. Xuyu Zhang</h6>
                            <p class="about_side_title_color">Principal Dentist </p>
                            <p class="about_para_size">
                                Dr. Xuyu Zhang is a graduate of the UCSF School of Dentistry who believes that a healthy
                                mouth is the cornerstone to not only a beautiful smile, but good health overall. Under
                                Dr. Zhang's care, everyone is given special attention and allowed to address individual
                                concerns/cases; no two patients are alike.
                            </p>
                            <p class="about_para_size">
                                Dr Zhang immigrated to the United States from China at 15 years old. He received his
                                bachelor's degree in Biology from Occidental College in Los Angeles. He loves being a
                                dentist. He is fluent in English, Cantonese, and Mandarin.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card mb-4 box-shadow">
                        <svg class="bd-placeholder-img card-img-top" width="100%" height="225"
                             xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" focusable="false"
                             role="img" aria-label="Placeholder: Thumbnail"><title>Dr. Allen Lee</title>
                            <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="#55595c"></rect>
                            <text x="50%" y="50%" fill="#eceeef" dy=".3em">Dr. Allen Lee</text>
                        </svg>
                        <div id="profile02" class="card-body">
                            <h6 class="about_title_weight">Dr. Allen Lee</h6>
                            <p class="about_side_title_color">Consultant</p>
                            <p class="about_para_size">
                                Dr. Allen Lee is a graduate of the Boston University dental school, one of the best in
                                the country. He has been a dentist for years and has been through several post graduate
                                courses in different fields of dentistry since receiving his D.M.D. degree.
                            </p>
                            <p class="about_para_size">
                                His emphasis on patient comfort as well as keeping up-to-date with the latest
                                advancements in dentistry enable him to provide his patients with the best quality of
                                care in the field. Dr. Lee has a wide range of experience in different areas of
                                dentistry, from cosmetic and restorative dentistry to surgical treatments and root canal
                                treatments.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card mb-4 box-shadow">
                        <svg class="bd-placeholder-img card-img-top" width="100%" height="225"
