                        <div id="profile03" class="card-body">
                            <h6 class="about_title_weight">Doris</h6>
                            <p class="about_side_title_color">Manager, RDA</p>
                            <p class="about_para_size">
                                Fluent in both English and Mandarin, Doris enjoys meeting new people and helping our
                                patients achieve best oral health health possible. What most patients love about Doris
